	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Sane nihil superioribus duobus proximis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mercatus diebus scripsi, quod vehementer distrahar <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et curis et negotiis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nunc cum tuas amicissimas <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>accepi una cum decretis 5. sessionis, committere non <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>potui, quin pauca haec ad te.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Pro decretis <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>gratias ago, habui tamen prius; habere cuperem <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>3. et 4. sessionis decreta ac scire, an sessio <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>6. habita sit 17. septembris et quid decretum.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Video <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>tibi quod mihi evenire: omnes volunt sibi scribi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et perquiri, quid ubique gentium fiat, ipsi <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tamen segnes et ignavi nihil perquirunt <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>vel in vicinia, nihil scribunt, laborare nec <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>volunt nec possunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Ist alles mitt liederliche <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>und sorglosse by yederman gar nach gantz nur<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>wen zerlütteret und lodelächt.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">At praestaret nos <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>scire istorum hominum decreta et consilia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Videbis, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>videbis, experieris, nisi dominus interturbarit <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>concilium, hoc ipsum concilium imparatum et <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>in re non praemeditata daturum ingens damnum.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Ergo si quid potes, labora; si nihil datur <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>aut mittitur, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quid tu poteris mihi?</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><foreign xml:lang="de">[Ich] bin wol [m]itt üch [z]uͦfriden;</foreign> non accuso te et tuam <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>diligentiam, imo gratulor mihi, qui te habeam <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>instructum et diligentem et laboriosum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Et quia <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>te vere diligo, en communico tecum, quae cum paucis; <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>principio literas episcopi <placeName ref="l951">Sarisberiensis</placeName> ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>deinde literas <persName ref="p8033">Bezae</persName>, quibus nobis valedicit<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">hiezu a.R. unleserlich. Bemerkung, viell.: "Oro autem, ut tuto et cito remittas omnia."</note> per postam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>enim descendit per <placeName ref="l41">Bernam</placeName> et <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName> <placeName ref="l491">Argentinam</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Ibi expectavit d. <persName>Andelotus</persName>, cum quo sequitur <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>instructissimum <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName> exercitum, quem arbitror <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>iam esse in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName>, id quod intelliges ex literis <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>e <placeName ref="l210">Heidelberga</placeName> allatis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Heri hic fuit vir fide <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>dignus, qui dixit,</foreign> das er den gantzen zug gesähen <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>in grossen und guͦten huffen ziehen hin für <lb xml:id="p1z35"/><placeName ref="l956">Nanzey</placeName> in <placeName ref="l691">Lothringen</placeName> ylendts ylents uff <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Idem dixit, sicuti et alii affirmant, quod mense <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>septembri naves <placeName ref="l830">Angli</placeName> appulerint et recepti sint <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ad Sanctum Valerium et in portu Diepensi et <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>quod iam egressi contendant in hostem.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dominus adsit <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>eis etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> sind 16. septembris von <placeName ref="l301">Leon</placeName> zogen von <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>den iren uffs höchst abgemanet; doch sind noch da im zuͦsatz bliben 6 <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>fenli <placeName ref="l791">Wallisser</placeName>, <placeName ref="l339">Nüwenburger</placeName>, <placeName ref="l49">Bieler</placeName>, <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>sind die fenli von nüwem uffgericht.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Der herr <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>von Anderes sol ouch dahin mitt 600 pferden und 40<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>00 zuͦ fuͦß ziehen, der herrlicher sige<lb xml:id="p1z46"/>n 2 in <lb xml:id="p1z47"/><placeName>Provincia</placeName> gehept.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Man achtet, die 8 <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>fendli der eydgnossen, die jetzt hinwäg ziehend, werdint <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>für <placeName ref="l301">Leon</placeName> müssen oder an die <placeName ref="l822">Tütschen</placeName> etc.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Dominus rependet eis pro <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>suo iudi<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>c<lb xml:id="p2z3"/>io iusto<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">gestrichen</note> Nunc agitur 31. annus, quum ad Capellas nos trucidarunt; <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>scio autem deum vivere etc.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p458">Brentius</persName> Latine et <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Germanice contra <persName ref="p8111">Martyrem</persName> et m<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>e <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>scripsit impurum librum etc<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">dazu a.R.: "38 bogen tütsch."</note>.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Darvon schrib ich <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>fürohin nitt immerdar; achtends nitt.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Sunt <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>et alia negotia, quae me profecto opprimunt et e<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>necant.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Zuͦ <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> stadt es zwyträchtig und <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>übel.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Bittend go<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>tt umb gnad<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">dazu a.R.: "Maledictus, qui confidit in hominem."</note>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Legati regis <placeName ref="l875">Hispan<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ie</placeName> in <placeName ref="l862">Helvetia</placeName> impetrarunt,</foreign> das sy u<lb xml:id="p2z14"/>ff trium regum ein früntlichen tag zuͦ <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> ze besuͦchen verheyssen und zuͦ losen etc<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">dazu a.R.: "D. <persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName> wirpt umb urloub, wirt am ampt nitt blyben etc."</note>.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Sampstags 10. octobris</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Der üwer <persName ref="p495">H[einrychus] B[ullingerus]</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">P<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>raestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Cur<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>iensis</placeName> ecclesiae ministro fideli, domino et com<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>patri meo colendo et dilectissimo.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de">Dem herren p<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>farrer zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Sant Martin zuͦ <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>